<!--
    Melodix tablet tokens (smallest width >= 600dp).

    A real tablet layout, not a magnified phone. The differences are per role:
    wider gutters so content does not run edge to edge; larger touch targets
    and transport controls; bigger artwork and shelf cards so a shelf shows
    fewer, larger covers instead of a thin strip of phone-sized ones; a taller
    navigation bar with readable labels; a larger full-player cover.

    Only tokens that genuinely differ are repeated. Everything else inherits
    the phone value, keeping the two form factors consistent.
-->
